        "created_at": "2013-03-21T11:55:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If I can't choose EVERYTHING!!!! as my choice I have to go with the story, the fact that it's being leaked out so slowly in the flavour text and card images is awesome.</p><p>The gameplay gets me to come back for more every time, but the storyline is what makes me want to speculate wildly about it 24/7</p>",
